#: setupwizard.cpp:73 setupwizard.cpp:533
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: setupwizard.cpp:128
msgid ""
"<qt><p>This wizard will ask you a few questions about your network.</p> "
"<p>Usually you can simply keep the suggested settings.</p> <p>After you have "
"finished the wizard, you will be able to browse and use shared resources on "
"your LAN, not only Samba/Windows shares, but also FTP, HTTP and NFS "
"resources exactly the same way.</p> <p>Therefore you need to setup the "
"<i>LAN Information Server</i> (LISa) on your machine. Think of the LISa "
"server as an FTP or HTTP server; it has to be run by root, it should be "
"started during the boot process and only one LISa server can run on one "
"machine.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>這個精靈將會問您一點點關於您網絡的問題。</p><p>通常您保留建議設定即"
"可。</p><p>在您完成這個精靈之後，您將可以瀏覽並且使用在您區域網路上分享的資"
"源，不只是 Samba/Windows 的分享資源，還可以同樣方法存取 FTP, HTTP 和 NFS 的資"
"源。</p><p>因此您需要在您的機器上設定<i>區域網絡資訊伺服器</i>(LISa)。您可以"
"將 LISa 視為 FTP 或 HTTP 伺服器；它必須以系統管理員（root）的身份來執行，它應"
"該在開機時啟動，並且一部機器只能執行一個 LISa server 。</qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:151
msgid ""
"<qt><p>More than one network interface card was found on your system.</"
"p><p>Please choose the one to which your LAN is connected.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>在您的系統上發現超過一張以上的網絡卡。</p><p>請選擇您的區域網路連結的"
"那一張。</p></qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<qt><p><b>No network interface card was found on your system.</b></"
"p><p>Possible reason: no network card is installed. You probably want to "
"cancel now or enter your IP address and network manually</p>Example: "
"<code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</code>.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p><b>在您的系統上沒有發現網絡卡。</b></p><p>可能的理由：沒有安裝網絡卡。"
"您現在也許想要離開，或是手動地輸入您的 IP 位址和網絡設定。</p>例子: "
"<code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</code> 。</qt>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:190
msgid "There are two ways LISa can search hosts on your network."
msgstr "LISa 可有兩個方法在您的網絡上搜尋主機。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:192
msgid "Send pings"
msgstr "送出 ping 訊號"

#: setupwizard.cpp:193
msgid ""
"All hosts with TCP/IP will respond,<br>whether or not they are samba servers."
"<br>Don't use it if your network is very large, i.e. more than 1000 hosts."
"<br>"
msgstr ""
"所有使用 TCP/IP 的主機將回應，<br>不論他們是否 samba 伺服器。<br>如果您的網絡"
"很大，例如超過 1000 台主機，不要使用這個方法。<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:196
msgid "Send NetBIOS broadcasts"
msgstr "送出 NetBIOS 廣播"

#: setupwizard.cpp:197
msgid ""
"You need to have the samba package (nmblookup) installed.<br>Only samba/"
"windows servers will respond.<br>This method is not very reliable.<br>You "
"should enable it if you are part of a large network."
msgstr ""
"您需要安裝 samba 套件（nmblookup）。<br>只有 samba/windows 伺服器會回應。<br>"
"這個方法並不十分可靠。<br>如果您網絡很大，您應該使用這個方法。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:206 setupwizard.cpp:234 setupwizard.cpp:258
#: setupwizard.cpp:281 setupwizard.cpp:310 setupwizard.cpp:361
msgid "<b>If unsure, keep it as is.</b>"
msgstr "<b>如果不肯定，保持原狀。</b>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:215
msgid ""
"All IP addresses included in the specified range will be pinged.<br>If you "
"are part of a small network, e.g. with network mask 255.255.255.0<br>use "
"your IP address/network mask.<br>"
msgstr ""
"所有包含在指定範圍內的 IP 位址將會以 ping 訊號測試。<br>如果您是一個小型網絡"
"的一部分，例如網路遮罩為 255.255.255.0<br>使用您的 IP 位址/網絡遮罩。<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:221
msgid ""
"<br>There are four ways to specify address ranges:<br>1. IP address/network "
"mask, like <code>192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;</code><br>2. single IP "
"addresses, like <code>10.0.0.23;</code><br>3. continuous ranges, like "
"<code>10.0.1.0-10.0.1.200;</code><br>4. ranges for each part of the address, "
"like <code>10-10.1-5.1-25.1-3;</code><br>You can also enter combinations of "
"1 to 4, separated by \";\", "
"like<br><code>192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;10.0.0.0;10.0.1.1-10.0.1.100;</"
"code><br>"
msgstr ""
"<br>指定位址範圍有四個方法：<br>1. IP 位址/網絡遮罩，例如 "
"<code>192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;</code><br>2. 單一 IP 位址，例如 "
"<code>10.0.0.23;</code><br>3. 連續的範圍，例如 <code>10.0.1.0-10.0.1.200;</"
"code><br>4. 位址每個部份的範圍，例如 <code>10-10.1-5.1-25.1-3;</code><br>您也"
"可以輸入 1 到 4 的組合，使用「;」分開，<br>例如 "
"<code>192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;10.0.0.0;10.0.1.1-10.0.1.100;</code><br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:243
msgid ""
"This is a security related setting.<br>It provides a simple IP address based "
"way to specify \"trusted\" hosts.<br>Only hosts which fit into the addresses "
"given here are accepted by LISa as clients. The list of hosts published by "
"LISa will also only contain hosts which fit into this scheme.<br>Usually you "
"enter your IP address/network mask here."
msgstr ""
"這是個有關安全的設定。<br>它提供一個簡易的以 IP 位址為基礎的方式來指定「可信"
"任的」主機。<br>只有符合這裡提供的位址的主機才會被 LISa 所接受為客戶端。由 "
"LISa 所發佈的主機列表也只包含符合這規範的主機。<br>通常您在這兒輸入您的 IP 位"
"址/網絡遮罩。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:267
msgid ""
"<br>Enter your IP address and network mask here, like "
"<code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</code>"
msgstr ""
"<br>在這兒輸入您的 IP 位址和網絡遮罩，例如 <code>192.168.0.1/255.255.255.0</"
"code>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:272
msgid ""
"<br>To reduce the network load, the LISa servers in one network<br>cooperate "
"with each other. Therefore you have to enter the broadcast<br>address here. "
"If you are connected to more than one network, choose <br>one of the "
"broadcast addresses."
msgstr ""
"<br>為了減少網絡負載，在網絡上的 LISa 伺服器<br>會彼此合作。因此您要在此輸入"
"廣播位址。<br>如果您連接到一個以上的網路，請選擇其中一個<br>廣播位址。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:292
msgid ""
"<br>Enter the interval after which LISa, if busy, will update its host list."
msgstr "<br>輸入當 LISa 忙碌時，下一次更新主機列表的時間間隔。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:300
msgid ""
"<br>Please note that the update interval will grow automatically by up to 16 "
"times the value you enter here, if nobody accesses the LISa server. So if "
"you enter 300 sec = 5 min here, this does not mean that LISa will ping your "
"whole network every 5 minutes. The interval will increase up to 16 x 5 min = "
"80 min."
msgstr ""
"<br>請留意，若沒有人存取 LISa 伺服器，更新間隔會自動增長至最高您輸入數值的十"
"六倍。所以若果您在此輸入 300 秒，即 5 分鐘， LISa 不一定會每 5 分鐘進行 ping "
"訊號測試。該間隔會增長最高至 16 x 5 分鐘 = 80 分鐘。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:320
msgid ""
"This page contains several settings you usually only<br>need if LISa doesn't "
"find all hosts in your network."
msgstr "如果 LISa 無法在您的網絡上發現所有主機，<br>本頁包含一些您需要的設定。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:323
msgid "Re&port unnamed hosts"
msgstr "報告未命名的主機(&P)"

#: setupwizard.cpp:324
msgid ""
"Should hosts for which LISa can't resolve the name be included in the host "
"list?<br>"
msgstr "LISa 無法解析主機名稱的主機該被包含在主機列表裡嗎？<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:328
msgid "Wait for replies after first scan"
msgstr "等待第一次掃描後的回覆"

#: setupwizard.cpp:333
msgid ""
"How long should LISa wait for answers to pings?<br>If LISa doesn't find all "
"hosts, try to increase this value.<br>"
msgstr ""
"LISa 應該等待 ping 訊號的回應多久時間？<br>如果 LISa 無法發現所有的主機，試著"
"增加這個值。<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:337
msgid "Max. number of pings to send at once"
msgstr "同一時間送出 ping 封包的最大數目"

#: setupwizard.cpp:342
msgid ""
"How many ping packets should LISa send at once?<br>If LISa doesn't find all "
"hosts you could try to decrease this value.<br>"
msgstr ""
"LISa 應該同一時間送出多少的 ping 封包？<br>如果 LISa 無法發現所有的主機，試著"
"減少這個值。<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:345
msgid "Al&ways scan twice"
msgstr "總是掃描兩次(&W)"

#: setupwizard.cpp:349
msgid "Wait for replies after second scan"
msgstr "等待第二次掃描後的回覆"

#: setupwizard.cpp:355
#, fuzzy
msgid "If LISa does not find all hosts, enable this option."
msgstr "如果 LISa 無法發現所有的主機，開啟這個選項。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:371
msgid ""
"<br>Your LAN browsing has been successfully set up.<br><br>Make sure that "
"the LISa server is started during the boot process. How this is done depends "
"on your distribution and OS. Usually you have to insert it somewhere in a "
"boot script under <code>/etc</code>.<br>Start the LISa server as root and "
"without any command line options.<br>The config file will now be saved to "
"<code>/etc/lisarc</code>.<br>To test the server, try <code>lan:/</code> in "
"Konqueror.<br><br>If you have problems or suggestions, visit http://lisa-"
"home.sourceforge.net."
msgstr ""
"<br>您的區域網絡瀏覽已成功設置。<br><br>請確定 LISa 伺服器已在開機過程中啟"
"動。如何完成啟動端視您的分發版本和作業系統。通常您必需在<code>/etc</code> 下"
"的 boot script 的某處插入設定。<br>以 root 身份啟動 LISa 伺服器，並且不要用任"
"何命令列選項。<br>設定檔將被儲存於 <code>/etc/lisarc</code> 。<br>然後在 "
"Konqueror 中試試 <code>lan:/</code>並且祝玩得愉快！:-)<br><br>如果您有任何問"
"題或建議，請瀏覽 http://lisa-home.sourceforge.net 。"

#: setupwizard.cpp:458
#, fuzzy
msgid "Congratulations"
msgstr "恭喜您！"

#: setupwizard.cpp:483
msgid "You can use the same syntax as on the previous page.<br>"
msgstr "您可以使用和上一頁相同的語法。<br>"

#: setupwizard.cpp:485
msgid ""
"There are three ways to specify IP addresses:<br>1. IP address/network mask, "
"like<code> 192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;</code><br>2. continuous ranges, "
"like<code> 10.0.1.0-10.0.1.200;</code><br>3. single IP addresses, like<code> "
"10.0.0.23;</code><br>You can also enter combinations of 1 to 3, separated by "
"\";\", <br>like<code> 192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;10.0.0.0;10.0.1.1-10.0.1.100;"
"</code><br>"
msgstr ""
"指定 IP 位址有三個方法：<br>1. IP 位址/網絡遮罩，例如<code> "
"192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;</code><br>2. 連續範圍，例如<code> 10.0.1.0-"
"10.0.1.200;</code><br>3. 單一 IP 位址，例如<code> 10.0.0.23;</code><br>您也可"
"以輸入 1 到 3 的組合，其中以「;」隔開，<br>例如<code> "
"192.168.0.0/255.255.255.0;10.0.0.0;10.0.1.1-10.0.1.100;</code><br>"

